OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies welcome changes to early
OL,4,Arelease scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe families of two children killed in
OL,7,Fseparate crimes have welcomed changes
OL,8,Fto the early prison release scheme,
OL,9,Fmeaning those guilty of involvement in
OL,10,Ftheir deaths will stay in prison.
OL,12,FOn Sunday, Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,13,Fsaid anyone convicted of unlawful
OL,14,Fkilling or allowing the death of a
OL,15,Fchild would be excluded from the
OL,16,Fscheme.
OL,18,FThe mother of Archie York, 7, who died
OL,19,Fin a Newcastle explosion caused by an
OL,20,Fillegal drugs lab in the flat below,
OL,21,Fsaid "we have finally got the news we
OL,22,Fwanted".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
