OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies welcome changes to early
OL,4,Arelease scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe great aunt of toddler Maya
OL,7,FChappell, who was shaken by her
OL,8,Fmother's boyfriend in Shotton Colliery,
OL,9,Fsaid the news was "such a relief".
OL,10,FMaya's mother was also jailed for
OL,11,Fallowing the death of a child.
